# Supabase Configuration
# Get these values from: https://supabase.com/dashboard -> Project Settings -> API

VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project-id.supabase.co
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-anon-key-here

# Instructions:
# 1. Create a free account at supabase.com
# 2. Create a new project
# 3. Copy the Project URL and anon public key from Project Settings -> API
# 4. Replace the values above with your actual credentials
# 5. Rename this file to .env.local (it's already in .gitignore)
# 6. Run the SQL from supabase-setup.sql in Supabase SQL Editor